> - 条件/判断类：三点定矩形框(three_pts_define_rect), 标记推断十字涂底(marker_cross_recolor), 忽略干扰项(ignore_distractors), 首尾跨度填充(span_fill_between), 边长循环变换(side_length_cycle), 按像素数降序(descending_pixel_count), 预测下一周期行(predict_next_cycle), 沿杆滑至锚定物(slide_stem_to_anchor), 填充位出标记色(filled_gets_marker), 邻域全匹配(all_neighbors_match), 选取最大面积对象(largest_area_selected), 仅相邻锚点间连接(connect_only_between_adjacent_anchors), 射线遇障碍翻转(ray_flips_on_obstacle), 标记定输出朝向(marker_fixes_orientation), 相位编码(phase_encoding), 镜像补缺并裁出(mirror_fill_missing_crop), 沿列填至底(fill_column_to_bottom), 恰一为前景(exactly_one_foreground), 空行填分隔色(blank_row_separator), 条高决定框厚(stripe_height_as_thickness), 奇偶交替选择(alternating_parity_selection)
