> - 条件/判断类：孔洞面积决定输出(enclosed_area_output), 单行重叠拼接(one_row_overlap), 四向对称扩展(four_way_symmetric_expansion), 含轨迹色行列移动(trail_color_move), 色带翻转到对侧(band_flip_opposite), 局部偏移保持(local_offset_preserved), 周期性延伸(periodic_extension), 角落象限提取(corner_quadrant_extraction), 背景色替换(background_replaced), 线段连接再填充(connect_then_fill), 各副本互补缺失(copies_complement), 朝匹配边移动(move_toward_match), 全空行列检测(detect_empty_row_col), 中点居中放置(center_at_midpoint), 重力沉降(gravity_settling), 包含全部目标色(contains_all_target_colors), 图例作为过滤器(legend_as_filter), 数量守恒(count_conservation), 最小包围框收缩(minimal_bounding_frame_shrink), 端点编码位移(endpoints_encode_disp)
